चत्तरघरिणी पिअदंसणा अ तरुणी पउत्थवइआअ,असई सअज्जिआदुग्गआ अ णह खंडिअं सीलं	Young and attractive and her husband abroad, Living in poverty at a busy crossroad, With loose women in the neighborhood, —You're not telling me she's still chaste?
अहिआइमाणिणो दुग्गअस्स छाइं पइस्स रक्खंही,णिअवंधवाण जूरइ घरिणी विहवेण एंताणं	Protecting the self-image of her husband, Who is poor but proud of his breeding, The wife scorns her own relatives As they arrive with rich presents.
