पोट्टपडिएहि दुक्खं अच्छिज्जइ उण्णएहि होऊण,इअ चिंतंताण मणे थणाण कसणं मुहं जाअं	Thinking how wretched it is To be sagging over her stomach After having once been prominent —That's how her breasts must have got dark nipples.
