ओसर रोत्तुं चिअ णिम्मिआइ मा पुससु मे हअच्छीइं,दंसणमेत्तुम्मइएहि जेहि सीलं तुह ण णाअं	Be off! Stop wiping away my tears! Crying is what my stupid eyes were made for. For when they tried looking they got distracted And failed to see your true nature.
