सत्थं अविरुद्धं जाणइ।	He knows the unopposed weapon.,
सव्वं लोके परं जाणइ।	He knows the other in all worlds.,
जीवं मुणी जाणइ।	The sage knows life.,
विसेसं अणु जाणइ।	He knows the subtlety of difference.,
वाग्दंडं सव्वं जाणइ।	He knows all restraint in speech.,
महत्तं पज्जस्स जाणइ।	He knows the greatness of glory.,
असव्वं अपवत्तं जाणइ।	He knows non-existence and non-activity.,
धम्मे अप्पणं जाणइ।	He knows the soul in Dharma.,
लोए अविरुद्धं जाणइ।	He knows the non-opposed in the world.,
कप्पं संखणं जाणइ।	He knows the eon and its count.,
माणवं सव्वं जाणइ।	He knows all human beings.,
विज्जा परं जाणइ।	He knows the highest knowledge.,
महत्तं सव्वं जाणइ।	He knows all greatness.,
सत्थं अहिंसा जाणइ।	He knows the weapon of non-violence.,
धम्मे परमं जाणइ।	He knows the supreme in Dharma.,
लोए अविरुद्धं धम्मं जाणइ।	He knows the non-opposed Dharma in the world.,
सव्वं अहिंसा जाणइ।	He knows all non-violence.,
