धम्मे अहिंसा विज्जा जाणइ।	He knows non-violence and knowledge in Dharma.,
सव्वं विज्जा धम्मं जाणइ।	He knows all knowledge in Dharma.,
अविरुद्धं विज्जा जाणइ।	He knows the unopposed knowledge.,
