अहिंसा पंचव्रती जाणइ धम्मं।	The follower of five vows knows non-violence through Dharma.,
जीवं अहिंसा जाणइ पंचमहाव्रतं।	He knows life and non-violence through the five great vows.,
लोके पंचमहाव्रती जाणइ सव्वं।	In the world, the observer of five great vows knows everything.,
सव्वं धम्मे पंचमहाव्रतं जाणइ।	Everything is known in Dharma through the five great vows.,
