जीवं सव्वं जाणइ पंचव्रतं।	He knows all life through the five vows.,
धम्मे पंचमहाव्रती जाणइ सव्वं।	The observer of five great vows knows everything through Dharma.,
लोए सव्वं जाणइ पंचव्रतं।	In the world, everything is known through the five vows.,
अहिंसा पंचव्रती जाणइ धम्मं।	The follower of five vows knows non-violence in Dharma.,
धम्मे पंचमहाव्रतं जाणइ सव्वं।	Everything is known through the five great vows in Dharma.,
लोए पंचव्रती धम्मं जाणइ।	In the world, the follower of five vows knows Dharma.,
जीवं अहिंसा पंचमहाव्रतं जाणइ।	He knows life and non-violence through the five great vows.,
धम्मे पंचमहाव्रती जाणइ सव्वं।	The observer of five great vows knows everything in Dharma.,
अम्हे सव्वे मणुस्सा समाणा, किं तु अम्हाणं कम्माइं विविहाइं।	We are all equal as human beings, but our actions are diverse.,
जीवणे बहुइं दुक्खाइं होंति, परं सुक्खस्स अणुहवो वि होइ।	Life has many sorrows, but there are also experiences of happiness.,
पयडी अम्हाणं माया, तीए रक्खणं कायव्वं सदा।	Nature is our mother, and we must always protect her.,
विज्जा धणं सव्वुत्तमं, जं कयावि ण णस्सइ।	Knowledge is the supreme wealth that can never be lost.,
जेण जेण संजोएण जं जं कम्मं समारद्धं, तं तं पावेइ णियमा।	Whatever action is begun with whatever intention, it surely bears that fruit.,
अहिंसा परमो धम्मो, तस्स पालणं कायव्वं सव्वेहिं।	Non-violence is the supreme dharma, it should be practiced by all.,
सव्वेसिं जीवाणं रक्खणं कायव्वं, ण केवलं मणुस्साणं।	Protection should be given to all living beings, not just humans.,
णाणं च कम्मं च दोण्णि वि महत्तराइं, एएहिं विणा जीवणं णिरत्थयं।	Both knowledge and action are important, life is meaningless without them.,
सव्वे जणा सुहिणो होंतु, सव्वे संतु णिरामया।	May all people be happy, may all be free from illness.,
जहा बीयं तहा फलं, जहा कम्मं तहा फलं।	As the seed, so the fruit; as the action, so the result.,
दाणं देंतो वि लहेइ, परोवयारो परमं सुहं।	One who gives also receives, helping others is the highest happiness.,
सव्वं अणिच्चं, परं णाणं णिच्चं।	Everything is impermanent, but knowledge is eternal.,
जीवणस्स सारो मित्तया, धणेण विणा वि जीविदुं सक्कं।	Friendship is the essence of life, one can live without wealth.,
कोहो दुक्खस्स मूलं, खमा सुहस्स कारणं।	Anger is the root of sorrow, forgiveness is the cause of happiness.,
सव्वं लोयं वसुहा कुडुंबयं, परस्परं रक्खणं कायव्वं।	The whole world is one family, we should protect each other.,
जं किंचि करेमो, तं सव्वं पयडीए अणुकूलं होउ।	Whatever we do, may it all be in harmony with nature.,
सव्वेसिं सुहं इच्छामो, तेण अम्हे वि सुहिणो होमो।	We wish happiness for all, thus we too become happy.,
जीवणं अच्चंतं चंचलं, तेण सदा सच्चं आयरियव्वं।	Life is extremely uncertain, therefore always practice truth.,
जहिं सच्चं तहिं धम्मो, जहिं धम्मो तहिं जओ।	Where there is truth, there is dharma; where there is dharma, there is victory.,
जं किंचि दिस्सइ तं णस्सइ, जं ण दिस्सइ तं सस्सयं।	Whatever is seen perishes, what is unseen is eternal.,
सव्वं दुक्खं सहियव्वं, सव्वं सुक्खं पत्थियव्वं।	All sorrow should be endured, all happiness should be wished for.,
जो सयं पडइ सो सयं उट्ठेइ, परस्स सहाओ ण अपेक्खियव्वो।	One who falls by oneself gets up by oneself, one shouldn't expect help from others.,
जहा चित्तं तहा वाया, जहा वाया तहा किया।	As the mind, so the speech; as the speech, so the action.,
सव्वेसु भूएसु दया कायव्वा, एसो धम्मो सणंतणो।	Compassion should be shown to all beings, this is the eternal dharma.,
जं मणे तं वाए, जं वाए तं कम्मे।	What's in the mind should be in speech, what's in speech should be in action.,
सव्वे जणा सुहिणो होंतु, सव्वे संतु णिरामया।	May all people be happy, may all be free from illness.,
जेण जेण विहीणा तं तं इच्छंति मणुया।	Whatever people lack, that they desire.,
अप्पाणं णिंदसु मा परं, एसो मग्गो विसुद्धीए।	Criticize yourself, not others; this is the path to purity.,
जो धम्मं रक्खइ सो धम्मेण रक्खिज्जइ।	One who protects dharma is protected by dharma.,
सव्वं परवसं दुक्खं, सव्वं अत्तवसं सुहं।	Everything dependent on others is sorrow, everything under one's control is happiness.,
जहा बीयं वुत्तं तहा फलं लब्भइ।	As the seed is sown, so is the fruit obtained.,
सच्चं अमया वाणी, अलियं विसमया वाणी।	Truth is nectar-like speech, falsehood is poison-like speech.,
सव्वेसिं मित्ताइं होंतु, वेराइं केणइ ण होंतु।	May all have friends, may no one have enemies.,
सव्वे जणा सुहिणो होंतु, दुक्खिणो मा होंतु केइ।	May all people be happy, may no one be sorrowful.,
सव्वेसिं कल्लाणं भवतु, सव्वेसिं स्वस्ति भवतु।	May there be well-being for all, may there be prosperity for all.,
जो धम्मं पालेइ सो रक्खिज्जइ।	One who observes dharma is protected.,
जं किंचि करेसि तं सव्वं पेम्मेण कुणसु, एसो जीवणस्स सारो।	Whatever you do, do it all with love; this is the essence of life.,
सव्वेसिं जीवाणं रक्खणं कायव्वं, एसो परमो धम्मो।	Protection of all living beings should be done; this is the highest dharma.,
अप्पसुएण बहुं जाणइ, बहुसुएण अप्पं जाणइ।	With little learning one knows much, with much learning one knows little.,
जो अप्पाणं जिणइ सो सव्वं जिणइ, एसो परमो विजओ।	One who conquers oneself conquers all; this is the supreme victory.,
सव्वं दुक्खं सहियव्वं, सव्वं सुक्खं वंदियव्वं।	All sorrow should be endured, all happiness should be welcomed.,
जहिं सच्चं तहिं धम्मो, जहिं धम्मो तहिं सच्चं।	Where there is truth, there is dharma; where there is dharma, there is truth.,
सव्वेसिं मित्तत्तं इच्छामो, केणइ सह वेरं ण कुणमो।	We desire friendship with all, we make enmity with none.,
जं मणे तं वाए, जं वाए तं कम्मे, एसो सुजणाणं गुणो।	What's in mind should be in speech, what's in speech should be in action; this is the virtue of good people.,
सव्वं लोयं वसुहा कुडुंबयं, परस्परं पेम्मं कायव्वं।	The whole world is one family, mutual love should be practiced.,
जो पयडीए मित्तं सो मणुस्साणं मित्तं, एसो सच्चो पयडीवाओ।	One who is a friend of nature is a friend of humans; this is true environmentalism.,
सव्वेसिं सुहं इच्छंतो सयं सुहं लहइ, एसो कम्मस्स णियमो।	One who wishes happiness for all attains happiness oneself; this is the law of karma.,
जं किंचि दिस्सइ तं णस्सइ, जं ण दिस्सइ तं सस्सयं।	Whatever is seen perishes, what is unseen is eternal.,
सव्वेसु भूएसु दया कायव्वा, एसो धम्मो सणंतणो।	Compassion should be shown to all beings; this is the eternal dharma.,
जहा बीयं तहा रुक्खो, जहा रुक्खो तहा फलं।	As the seed, so the tree; as the tree, so the fruit.,
सव्वं अणिच्चं, परं णाणं णिच्चं, एसो परमो सिद्धंतो।	Everything is impermanent, but knowledge is eternal; this is the supreme principle.,
जो सयं पडइ सो सयं उट्ठेइ, परोवयारं मा अपेक्खसु।	One who falls by oneself rises by oneself; don't expect help from others.,
जेण जेण संजोएण जं जं कम्मं समारद्धं, तं तं पावेइ णियमा।	Whatever action is begun with whatever intention, it surely bears that fruit.,
सव्वं परवसं दुक्खं, सव्वं अत्तवसं सुहं, एसो जीवणस्स सारो।	Everything dependent on others is sorrow, everything under one's control is happiness; this is the essence of life.,
जो धम्मं रक्खइ सो धम्मेण रक्खिज्जइ, एसो धम्मस्स महिमा।	One who protects dharma is protected by dharma; this is the glory of dharma.,
सच्चं अमया वाणी, अलियं विसमया वाणी, सच्चमेव जयइ।	Truth is nectar-like speech, falsehood is poison-like speech; truth alone triumphs.,
जं मणे तं वाए, जं वाए तं कम्मे, एसो उत्तमो आयारो।	What's in mind should be in speech, what's in speech should be in action; this is the best conduct.,
सव्वेसिं मित्ताइं होंतु, वेराइं केणइ ण होंतु, एसो मंगलवाओ।	May all have friends, may no one have enemies; this is an auspicious saying.,
सव्वे जणा सुहिणो होंतु, दुक्खिणो मा होंतु केइ, एसो करुणाभावो।	May all people be happy, may no one be sorrowful; this is the feeling of compassion.,
सव्वेसिं कल्लाणं भवतु, सव्वेसिं स्वस्ति भवतु, एसो सव्वहियत्थो।	May there be well-being for all, may there be prosperity for all; this is for the benefit of all.,
जो धम्मं पालेइ सो रक्खिज्जइ, एसो धम्मस्स फलं।	One who observes dharma is protected; this is the fruit of dharma.,
जो अप्पाणं विणेइ सो लोयं विणेइ, एसो णाणस्स सारो।	One who disciplines oneself disciplines the world; this is the essence of wisdom.,
सव्वं जगं मित्तं मे, ण कोइ सत्तू मे अत्थि।	The whole world is my friend, I have no enemies.,
जहा कम्मं तहा फलं, एसो कम्मस्स सिद्धंतो।	As the action, so the result; this is the principle of karma.,
सव्वेसिं जीवाणं रक्खणं कायव्वं, एसो परमो धम्मो।	Protection of all living beings should be done; this is the highest dharma.,
जं किंचि करेमो, तं सव्वं पयडीए अणुकूलं होउ।	Whatever we do, may it all be in harmony with nature.,
सव्वेसिं सुहं इच्छामो, तेण अम्हे वि सुहिणो होमो।	We wish happiness for all, thus we too become happy.,
जीवणं अच्चंतं चंचलं, तेण सदा सच्चं आयरियव्वं।	Life is extremely uncertain, therefore always practice truth.,
जहिं सच्चं तहिं धम्मो, जहिं धम्मो तहिं जओ।	Where there is truth, there is dharma; where there is dharma, there is victory.,
जं किंचि दिस्सइ तं णस्सइ, जं ण दिस्सइ तं सस्सयं।	Whatever is seen perishes, what is unseen is eternal.,
सव्वं दुक्खं सहियव्वं, सव्वं सुक्खं पत्थियव्वं।	All sorrow should be endured, all happiness should be wished for.,
जो सयं पडइ सो सयं उट्ठेइ, परस्स सहाओ ण अपेक्खियव्वो।	One who falls by oneself gets up by oneself, one shouldn't expect help from others.,
जहा चित्तं तहा वाया, जहा वाया तहा किया।	As the mind, so the speech; as the speech, so the action.
सच्चं बोल्लह, मा अलियं वयह।	Speak the truth, do not lie.,
जहा बीयं तहा फलं।	As the seed, so the fruit.,
सव्वेसिं मित्तो होहि, केणावि सह वेरं मा कुणसु।	Be a friend to all, make enemy of none.,
अप्पाणं जाणह, लोयं जाणह।	Know thyself, know the world.,
खमा वीरस्स भूसणं।	Forgiveness is the ornament of the brave.,
पयडीए रक्खणं कुणह।	Protect nature.,
अहिंसा परमो धम्मो।	Non-violence is the supreme dharma.,
अप्पं भणाहि, बहुं सुणाहि।	Speak little, listen much.,
