जहा रूवं तहा गुणो।	As the form, so the quality.,
अप्पाणं जिणह।	Conquer yourself.,
पयडी अम्हाणं माया।	Nature is our mother.,
विज्जा धणं सव्वुत्तमं।	Knowledge is the supreme wealth.,
जेण संतोसो तेण धणं।	One who is content is wealthy.,
सव्वेसु भूएसु दया कायव्वा।	Compassion should be shown to all beings.,
