जो सच्चं रक्खइ तं सच्चं रक्खइ।	One who protects truth is protected by truth.,
सव्वेसिं दुक्खाणं खया होंतु।	May all sorrows be destroyed.,
जहिं पेम्मं तहिं धम्मो।	Where there is love, there is dharma.,
अप्पाणं उज्जोएहि।	Illuminate yourself.,
जेण संतुट्ठो तेण धणवंतो।	One who is satisfied is wealthy.,
सव्वेसिं सुहाइं वड्ढंतु।	May the happiness of all increase.,
जो मित्तं रक्खइ सो अप्पाणं रक्खइ।	One who protects a friend protects oneself.,
पयडीए सेवा मणुस्सस्स सेवा।	Service to nature is service to humanity.,
जहिं दया तहिं धम्मो।	Where there is compassion, there is dharma.,
अप्पाणं सोहेहि।	Purify yourself.,
जो विज्जं रक्खइ सो धम्मं रक्खइ।	One who protects knowledge protects dharma.,
सव्वेसिं सुक्खाइं वड्ढंतु।	May the joys of all increase.,
जहिं सच्चं तहिं जओ।	Where there is truth, there is victory.,
अप्पाणं परिच्चयह।	Sacrifice yourself.,
जो सेवइ सो सेविज्जइ।	One who serves is served.,
सव्वेसिं मंगलं होउ।	May there be auspiciousness for all.,
जहिं णाणं तहिं मोक्खो।	Where there is knowledge, there is liberation.,
अप्पाणं समाहिं कुणह।	Meditate on yourself.,
जो दयं करेइ सो दयं लहेइ।	One who shows mercy receives mercy.,
सव्वेसिं विज्जा वड्ढउ।	May the knowledge of all increase.,
जहिं धम्मो तहिं सुक्खं।	Where there is dharma, there is happiness.,
