जो सेवइ सो सुहं लहेइ।	One who serves attains happiness.,
सव्वेसिं सद्धा वड्ढउ।	May the faith of all increase.,
जहिं सच्चं तहिं सुक्खं।	Where there is truth, there is happiness.,
अप्पाणं जागरह।	Awaken yourself.,
सव्वेसिं वीरिया वड्ढउ।	May the energy of all increase.,
जहिं धम्मो तहिं जओ।	Where there is dharma, there is victory.,
अप्पाणं समं कुणह।	Equalize yourself.,
जो खमइ सो जयइ।	One who forgives wins.,
सव्वेसिं सती वड्ढउ।	May the mindfulness of all increase.,
अप्पाणं मुंचह।	Free yourself.,
जो सिक्खइ सो जाणइ।	One who learns knows.,
सव्वेसिं समाही वड्ढउ।	May the concentration of all increase.,
जहिं करुणा तहिं धम्मो।	Where there is compassion, there is dharma.,
अप्पाणं बोहेहि।	Enlighten yourself.,
जो सेवइ सो सेविज्जइ।	One who serves is served.,
सव्वेसिं पञ्ञा वड्ढउ।	May the wisdom of all increase.,
जहिं सच्चं तहिं बलं।	Where there is truth, there is strength.,
अप्पाणं णिब्बुयं कुणह।	Make yourself peaceful.,
जो मित्तं लहेइ सो धणं लहेइ।	One who finds a friend finds wealth.,
सव्वेसिं खंती वड्ढउ।	May the patience of all increase.,
जहिं धम्मो तहिं सच्चं।	Where there is dharma, there is truth.,
अप्पाणं सुद्धं कुणह।	Purify yourself.,
जो सेवइ सो सिक्खइ।	One who serves learns.,
सव्वेसिं मेत्ती वड्ढउ।	May the friendliness of all increase.,
जहिं पेम्मं तहिं सच्चं।	Where there is love, there is truth.,
जो दयं करेइ सो सुहं लहेइ।	One who shows compassion attains happiness.,
सव्वेसिं करुणा वड्ढउ।	May the compassion of all increase.,
