सव्वे जणा सुहिणो होंतु, दुक्खिणो मा होंतु केइ।	May all people be happy, may no one be sorrowful.,
सच्चमेव जयइ णाणृतं, सच्चेण पंथो विततो देवयाणः।	Truth alone triumphs, not falsehood; by truth the divine path is spread.,
अप्पाणं णिंदसु मा परं, एसो मग्गो विसुद्धीए।	Criticize yourself, not others; this is the path to purity.,
सव्वं अणिच्चं, णाणं णिच्चं, एसो परमो सिद्धंतो।	Everything is impermanent, knowledge is permanent; this is the supreme principle.,
जहा मणो तहा वाणी, जहा वाणी तहा करणं।	As the mind, so the speech; as the speech, so the action.,
सव्वेसिं मित्ताइं होंतु, वेराइं केणइ ण होंतु।	May all have friends, may no one have enemies.,
पेम्मेण सव्वं जयइ, दोसेण सव्वं णस्सइ।	Love conquers all, hatred destroys all.,
अप्पसंतोसो महादोसो, संतोसो परमं सुहं।	Discontent is a great fault, contentment is the highest happiness.,
सव्वं परवसं दुक्खं, सव्वं अत्तवसं सुहं।	All dependence is sorrow, all self-control is happiness.,
जो धम्मं रक्खइ सो रक्खिज्जइ, एसो धम्मस्स महिमा।	One who protects dharma is protected; this is the glory of dharma.,
सुहस्स मूलं संतोसो, दुक्खस्स मूलं लोभो।	Contentment is the root of happiness, greed is the root of sorrow.,
जहा रूवं तहा गुणो, जहा गुणो तहा फलं।	As the form, so the quality; as the quality, so the fruit.,
सव्वेसिं संति होउ, सव्वेसिं सुहं होउ।	May there be peace for all, may there be happiness for all.,
अप्पाणं जिणह, तेण सव्वं जिणिस्ससि।	Conquer yourself, by that you will conquer all.,
पयडी अम्हाणं माया, तीए रक्खणं कायव्वं सदा।	Nature is our mother, we must always protect her.,
विज्जा धणं सव्वुत्तमं, जं कयावि ण णस्सइ।	Knowledge is the supreme wealth that can never be lost.,
जेण संतोसो तेण धणं, असंतुट्ठो सया दलिद्दो।	One who is content is wealthy, the discontented is always poor.,
सव्वेसु भूएसु दया कायव्वा, एसो धम्मो सणंतणो।	Compassion should be shown to all beings; this is the eternal dharma.,
जहा कम्मं तहा फलं, एसो कम्मस्स सिद्धंतो।	As the action, so the result; this is the principle of karma.,
जो अप्पाणं जिणइ सो सव्वं जिणइ, एसो परमो विजओ।	One who conquers oneself conquers all; this is the supreme victory.,
सव्वं लोयं वसुहा कुडुंबयं, परस्परं रक्खणं कायव्वं।	The whole world is one family; we should protect each other.,
जं मणे तं वाए, जं वाए तं कम्मे।	What's in mind should be in speech, what's in speech should be in action.,
सव्वेसिं सुहं इच्छामो, तेण अम्हे वि सुहिणो होमो।	We wish happiness for all, thus we too become happy.,
जो पयडीए मित्तं सो मणुस्साणं मित्तं, एसो सच्चो पयडीवाओ।	Friend of nature is friend of humans; this is true environmentalism.,
सव्वं अणिच्चं, परं णाणं णिच्चं, एसो परमो सिद्धंतो।	Everything is impermanent, but knowledge is eternal; this is the supreme principle.,
जीवणं अच्चंतं चंचलं, तेण सदा सच्चं आयरियव्वं।	Life is extremely uncertain, therefore always practice truth.,
सव्वेसिं जीवाणं रक्खणं कायव्वं, एसो परमो धम्मो।	Protection of all living beings should be done; this is the highest dharma.,
जहा बीयं वुत्तं तहा फलं लब्भइ, एसो पयडीए णियमो।	As the seed is sown, so is the fruit obtained; this is nature's law.,
सच्चं अमया वाणी, अलियं विसमया वाणी।	Truth is nectar-like speech, falsehood is poison-like speech.,
सव्वेसिं मित्ताइं होंतु, वेराइं केणइ ण होंतु, एसो मंगलवाओ।	May all have friends, may no one have enemies; this is an auspicious saying.,
अप्पसुएण बहुं जाणइ, बहुसुएण अप्पं जाणइ।	With little learning one knows much, with much learning one knows little.,
जो सयं पडइ सो सयं उट्ठेइ, परस्स सहाओ ण अपेक्खियव्वो।	One who falls by oneself rises by oneself; one shouldn't expect help from others.,
जहा चित्तं तहा वाया, जहा वाया तहा किया।	As the mind, so the speech; as the speech, so the action.,
जेण जेण विहीणा तं तं इच्छंति मणुया।	Whatever people lack, that they desire.,
जो धम्मं पालेइ सो रक्खिज्जइ, एसो धम्मस्स फलं।	One who observes dharma is protected; this is the fruit of dharma.,
जो अप्पाणं विणेइ सो लोयं विणेइ, एसो णाणस्स सारो।	One who disciplines oneself disciplines the world; this is the essence of wisdom.,
सव्वं जगं मित्तं मे, ण कोइ सत्तू मे अत्थि।	The whole world is my friend, I have no enemies.,
जहिं सच्चं तहिं धम्मो, जहिं धम्मो तहिं जओ।	Where there is truth, there is dharma; where there is dharma, there is victory.,
जं किंचि दिस्सइ तं णस्सइ, जं ण दिस्सइ तं सस्सयं।	Whatever is seen perishes, what is unseen is eternal.,
जो सच्चं रक्खइ तं सच्चं रक्खइ, एसो सच्चस्स महिमा।	One who protects truth is protected by truth; this is the glory of truth.,
सव्वेसिं दुक्खाणं खया होंतु, सव्वेसिं सुहाणं वुड्ढी होउ।	May all sorrows be destroyed, may all happiness increase.,
जहिं पेम्मं तहिं धम्मो, जहिं धम्मो तहिं पेम्मं।	Where there is love, there is dharma; where there is dharma, there is love.,
अप्पाणं उज्जोएहि, तेण लोओ उज्जोइज्जिस्सइ।	Illuminate yourself, by that the world will be illuminated.,
जेण संतुट्ठो तेण धणवंतो, असंतुट्ठो णिच्चं दरिद्दो।	One who is satisfied is wealthy, the unsatisfied is always poor.,
सव्वेसिं सुहाइं वड्ढंतु, दुक्खाइं विणस्संतु।	May the happiness of all increase, may sorrows be destroyed.,
जो मित्तं रक्खइ सो अप्पाणं रक्खइ, मित्तं परमं रक्खणं।	One who protects a friend protects oneself; a friend is the supreme protection.,
पयडीए सेवा मणुस्सस्स सेवा, पयडी अम्हाणं जणणी।	Service to nature is service to humanity; nature is our mother.,
जहिं दया तहिं धम्मो, जहिं धम्मो तहिं मोक्खो।	Where there is compassion, there is dharma; where there is dharma, there is liberation.,
सव्वे जीवा कम्म-बद्धा।	All souls are bound by karma.,
अहिंसा परमो धम्मो।	Non-violence is the highest dharma.,
सच्चं भणे, मिच्छं ण भणे।	Speak the truth, do not speak falsehood.,
अप्पाणं पि पियं मण्णे।	Consider oneself as dear.,
सव्वेसिं भूयाणं दया कायव्वा।	Compassion should be shown to all beings.,
णाणेण सव्वं पयासइ।	Everything is illuminated by knowledge.,
कम्मं खवेइ सुद्धप्पा।	The pure soul destroys karma.,
संसारो दुक्खमूलो।	The cycle of rebirth is the root of suffering.,
मोक्खो परमं सुक्खं।	Liberation is the highest happiness.
सव्वे जीवा कम्म-बद्धा।	All souls are bound by karma.,
अहिंसा परमो धम्मो।	Non-violence is the highest dharma.,
