मोक्खो परमं सुक्खं।	Liberation is the highest happiness.,
जीवो अणंतणाणी।	The soul has infinite knowledge.,
कम्मं जीवस्स वेरी।	Karma is the enemy of the soul.,
सम्मत्तं मोक्खमग्गो।	Right belief is the path to liberation.,
अप्पा सो परमप्पा।	The self is the supreme self.,
सव्वे जीवा समाणा।	All souls are equal.,
णाणं परमं बलं।	Knowledge is the supreme power.,
अहिंसा सव्वधम्माणं मूलं।	Non-violence is the root of all dharmas.,
लोभो पावस्स कारणं।	Greed is the cause of sin.,
तवसा किलिस्सइ अप्पा।	The soul is purified through penance.,
सम्मदंसण-णाण-चरित्ताणि मोक्खमग्गो।	Right vision, knowledge, and conduct are the path to liberation.,
इंदियाणि जेइ जो, सो जिणो।	One who conquers the senses is a conqueror.,
जीवो अमरो।	The soul is immortal.,
कोहो महा-विसं।	Anger is a great poison.,
माणो दुक्खस्स मूलं।	Pride is the root of suffering.,
माया पावस्स जणणी।	Deceit is the mother of sin.,
खमा वीरस्स भूसणं।	Forgiveness is the ornament of the brave.,
दाणं परमं बलं।	Charity is the supreme strength.,
