खमा वीरस्स भूसणं।	Forgiveness is the ornament of the brave.,
दाणं परमं बलं।	Charity is the supreme strength.,
लोए पंचव्रतं हवे।	In the world, the five vows are everything.,
मरणं जाणइ सव्वं।	He knows all death.,
सव्वं अहिंसा जाणइ।	Non-violence is everything.,
धम्मे सव्वं जाणइ।	In Dharma, all is known.,
जीवं पवत्तं जाणइ।	He knows the flow of life.,
सव्वं जीवं जाणइ।	He knows all living beings.,
मग्गं सव्वं जाणइ।	He knows the path to everything.,
अहिंसा लोए जाणइ।	Non-violence is known in the world.,
धम्मे लोए पंचव्रतं जाणइ।	He knows the five vows of Dharma in the world.,
जीवं पंचव्रतं जाणइ।	He knows life through the five vows.,
अहिंसा पंचव्रतं जाणइ।	Non-violence is known through the five vows.,
लोके पंचमहाव्रतं जाणइ।	He knows the five great vows in the world.,
सव्वं पंचमहाव्रती जाणइ।	The observer of the five great vows knows everything.,
लोए पंचमहाव्रती जाणइ।	He knows everything in the world through the five great vows.,
लोए सव्वं जाणइ पंचव्रतं।	In the world, he knows everything through the five vows.,
जीवं पंचमहाव्रती जाणइ।	He knows life through the five great vows.,
धम्मे पंचव्रतं जाणइ।	He knows everything through Dharma's five vows.,
जीवं अहिंसा जाणइ पंचव्रतं।	Life and non-violence are known through the five vows.,
धम्मे अहिंसा पंचमहाव्रतं जाणइ।	Non-violence is known in Dharma through the five great vows.,
लोके पंचमहाव्रतं जाणइ अहिंसा।	In the world, non-violence is known through the five great vows.,
धम्मे पंचमहाव्रती जाणइ लोए।	The observer of the five great vows knows everything in Dharma.,
जीवं पंचमहाव्रतं जाणइ सव्वं।	He knows life and everything through the five great vows.,
लोए पंचमहाव्रतं जाणइ धम्मं।	In the world, the five great vows and Dharma are known.,
धम्मे पंचव्रतं जाणइ सव्वं।	Everything is known through the five vows in Dharma.,
लोके पंचमहाव्रती जाणइ धम्मं।	The observer of the five great vows knows Dharma in the world.,
धम्मे सव्वं जाणइ पंचमहाव्रतं।	Everything is known in Dharma through the five great vows.,
अज्जए विय ममस्सं सुहस्स संपत्तिओ	Today my heart overflows with joy.
